#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:27
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:186
msgid "Preguntas frecuentes"
msgstr "Frequently asked questions"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:34
msgid ""
"indecap-aprende tiene tres tipos de cuenta: administradores, docentes y "
"estudiantes. Nadie se registra solo: las cuentas las crea el equipo del "
"instituto."
msgstr ""
"indecap-aprende has three types of account: administrators, teachers and "
"students. Nobody signs up on their own: accounts are created by the "
"institute's staff."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:36
msgid "Administrador principal"
msgstr "Main administrator"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:36
msgid "crea administradores, docentes y estudiantes."
msgstr "creates administrators, teachers and students."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:37
msgid "Administradores"
msgstr "Administrators"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:37
msgid "crean docentes y estudiantes."
msgstr "create teachers and students."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:38
msgid "Docentes"
msgstr "Teachers"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:38
msgid "crean estudiantes, los organizan en grupos y siguen su avance."
msgstr "create students, organize them into groups and follow their progress."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:39
msgid "Estudiantes"
msgstr "Students"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:39
msgid "juegan las actividades que su docente les asignó."
msgstr "play the activities their teacher assigned."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:41
msgid ""
"Para ingresar, elige el tipo de acceso antes de escribir el correo: "
"«Docente» para docentes y administradores, «Estudiante» para estudiantes."
" Si eliges el acceso equivocado, la plataforma te indica cuál usar."
msgstr ""
"To sign in, choose the type of access before typing your email: "
"\"Teacher\" for teachers and administrators, \"Student\" for students. If"
" you choose the wrong one, the platform tells you which one to use."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:42
msgid "Para empezar a trabajar con un grupo"
msgstr "To start working with a group"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:44
msgid "En Registro de estudiantes, crea un grupo con «+ Añadir grupo»."
msgstr "In Student registry, create a group with \"+ Add group\"."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:45
msgid ""
"En ese grupo, usa «+ Añadir estudiante» y marca los trastornos que "
"trabajará."
msgstr ""
"In that group, use \"+ Add student\" and check the conditions they will "
"work on."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:46
msgid "Entrega al estudiante su correo y su contraseña."
msgstr "Give the student their email and password."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:47
msgid "Revisa las actividades en Modo maestro antes de la clase."
msgstr "Review the activities in Teacher Mode before class."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:48
msgid "Sigue su avance en Panel general y en su historial."
msgstr "Follow their progress in the General dashboard and in their history."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:54
msgid "Es la primera página al ingresar. Resume la actividad de tus estudiantes."
msgstr ""
"It is the first page after signing in. It summarizes your students' "
"activity."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:56
msgid ""
"Las cuatro tarjetas superiores muestran los estudiantes activos, los "
"planes asignados, el trastorno más trabajado y las partidas del periodo "
"elegido."
msgstr ""
"The four cards at the top show active students, assigned plans, the most "
"practiced condition and the games played in the selected period."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:57
msgid ""
"El gráfico compara partidas completadas y actividades superadas. Puedes "
"cambiar el periodo (7 días a 1 año), verlo por día o por semana, o elegir"
" fechas exactas con «Personalizado»."
msgstr ""
"The chart compares completed games and passed activities. You can change "
"the period (7 days to 1 year), view it by day or by week, or pick exact "
"dates with \"Custom\"."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:58
msgid ""
"En la lista de la derecha, toca a un estudiante para ver solo su "
"actividad en el gráfico; vuelve a tocarlo para ver a todos. «Ver perfil» "
"abre su historial."
msgstr ""
"In the list on the right, tap a student to see only their activity in the"
" chart; tap again to see everyone. \"View profile\" opens their history."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:60
msgid "Avisos"
msgstr "Alerts"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:61
msgid ""
"La campana avisa cuando un estudiante supera una actividad. El punto rojo"
" indica que hay avisos sin leer. Dentro del menú puedes marcarlos todos "
"como leídos y activar o apagar el sonido. El sonido se guarda solo en "
"este navegador."
msgstr ""
"The bell lets you know when a student passes an activity. The red dot "
"means there are unread notifications. In the menu you can mark them all "
"as read and turn the sound on or off. The sound setting is saved only in "
"this browser."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:62
msgid ""
"El botón ES / EN cambia el idioma de toda la plataforma, incluidas las "
"instrucciones de los juegos."
msgstr ""
"The ES / EN button changes the language of the whole platform, including "
"the game instructions."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:67
msgid ""
"Aquí organizas a tus estudiantes por grupos. Cada estudiante pertenece a "
"un solo grupo a la vez."
msgstr ""
"Here you organize your students into groups. Each student belongs to one "
"group at a time."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:70
msgid ""
"Crea la cuenta del estudiante dentro del grupo. Los trastornos que "
"marques definen qué juegos verá en su panel. La contraseña debe tener al "
"menos 8 caracteres."
msgstr ""
"Creates the student's account inside the group. The conditions you check "
"decide which games they see on their dashboard. The password must be at "
"least 8 characters long."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:71
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/registro_estudiantes.html:126
msgid "Historial"
msgstr "History"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:72
msgid "Abre el seguimiento del estudiante. También puedes tocar su nombre."
msgstr "Opens the student's follow-up. You can also tap their name."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:74
msgid "Cambia sus datos y los trastornos asignados."
msgstr "Changes their details and assigned conditions."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:75
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/registro_estudiantes.html:141
msgid "Mover"
msgstr "Move"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:76
msgid "Lo pasa a otro de tus grupos. Aparece cuando tienes más de un grupo."
msgstr ""
"Moves them to another of your groups. It appears when you have more than "
"one group."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:77
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/registro_estudiantes.html:146
msgid "Desvincular"
msgstr "Unlink"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:78
msgid ""
"Lo deja inactivo en el grupo sin borrar nada. Aparece en «Estudiantes "
"inactivos», desde donde puedes reactivarlo."
msgstr ""
"Makes them inactive in the group without deleting anything. They appear "
"under \"Inactive students\", where you can reactivate them."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:79
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/registro_estudiantes.html:224
msgid "Eliminar cuenta"
msgstr "Delete account"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:80
msgid ""
"Solo está disponible para estudiantes inactivos. La persona ya no puede "
"ingresar, pero sus partidas, avisos e historial quedan guardados. Un "
"administrador puede restaurar la cuenta."
msgstr ""
"Only available for inactive students. The person can no longer sign in, "
"but their games, notifications and history are kept. An administrator can"
" restore the account."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:81
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/registro_estudiantes.html:62
msgid "Eliminar grupo"
msgstr "Delete group"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:82
msgid ""
"Solo se puede cuando el grupo ya no tiene estudiantes. Muévelos a otro "
"grupo antes."
msgstr ""
"Only possible when the group has no students left. Move them to another "
"group first."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:88
msgid ""
"Reúne todo lo que el estudiante ha jugado. Úsalo para planear qué "
"reforzar en clase."
msgstr ""
"Brings together everything the student has played. Use it to plan what to"
" reinforce in class."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:90
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/informe_estudiante.html:106
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/student_profile.html:75
msgid "Avance por juego"
msgstr "Progress by game"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:90
msgid ""
"actividades superadas de las 50 de cada juego, partidas y promedio "
"reciente."
msgstr ""
"activities passed out of the 50 in each game, games played and recent "
"average."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:91
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/informe_estudiante.html:134
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/student_profile.html:115
#: app/templates/games/play.html:180
msgid "Para reforzar"
msgstr "To reinforce"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:91
msgid ""
"las habilidades en las que más se equivocó en sus últimas 30 partidas. "
"Los repasos no cuentan."
msgstr ""
"the skills where they made the most mistakes in their last 30 games. "
"Reviews do not count."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:92
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/student_profile.html:96
msgid "Evolución"
msgstr "Progress over time"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:92
msgid "el puntaje promedio de cada una de las últimas 8 semanas."
msgstr "the average score for each of the last 8 weeks."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:93
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/informe_estudiante.html:162
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/student_profile.html:147
msgid "Últimas partidas"
msgstr "Latest games"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:93
msgid "fecha, actividad, puntaje, estrellas, tiempo y cómo se sintió."
msgstr "date, activity, score, stars, time and how they felt."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:95
msgid ""
"«¿Cómo se sintió?» es la autoevaluación que el estudiante responde al "
"terminar cada actividad (Bien, Regular o Me costó). Es opcional y sirve "
"para conversar con él sobre su experiencia, no para calificar."
msgstr ""
"\"How did they feel?\" is the self-assessment the student answers at the "
"end of each activity (Good, Okay or It was hard). It is optional and is "
"meant for talking with them about their experience, not for grading."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:100
msgid ""
"Muestra los ocho juegos tal como los ve el estudiante, con todas las "
"actividades abiertas. Lo que juegues aquí no se guarda como progreso de "
"nadie."
msgstr ""
"Shows the eight games exactly as the student sees them, with every "
"activity unlocked. Nothing you play here is saved as anyone's progress."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:102
msgid "Toca «Ver actividades» en el juego que quieres revisar."
msgstr "Tap \"See activities\" on the game you want to review."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:103
msgid ""
"Elige el nivel en las pestañas: Base, Media, Alta, Muy Alta o Súper "
"Difícil."
msgstr ""
"Choose the level in the tabs: Basic, Medium, High, Very High or Super "
"Hard."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:104
msgid ""
"Usa «Jugar» para proyectar la actividad en clase o «Respuestas» para ver "
"una hoja con los retos resueltos."
msgstr ""
"Use \"Play\" to project the activity in class or \"Answers\" to see a "
"sheet with the challenges solved."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:106
msgid ""
"La hoja de respuestas se genera con el mismo motor del juego: cada vez "
"que la abres cambian los valores. Puedes imprimirla con «Imprimir»."
msgstr ""
"The answer sheet is generated with the same engine as the game: the "
"values change every time you open it. You can print it with \"Print\"."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:111
msgid ""
"Cada juego tiene 5 niveles de 10 actividades. Cada actividad tiene 5 "
"retos que suben de dificultad. El estudiante abre la siguiente actividad "
"cuando supera la anterior."
msgstr ""
"Each game has 5 levels of 10 activities. Each activity has 5 challenges "
"that get harder. The student unlocks the next activity when they pass the"
" previous one."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:114
msgid "Resultado"
msgstr "Result"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:114
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/informe_estudiante.html:167
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/student_profile.html:156
msgid "Puntaje"
msgstr "Score"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:114
#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/informe_estudiante.html:114
msgid "Estrellas"
msgstr "Stars"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:116
msgid "Todos los retos bien al primer intento"
msgstr "Every challenge right on the first try"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:117
msgid "Pocos errores"
msgstr "Few mistakes"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:118
msgid "Actividad superada"
msgstr "Activity passed"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:119
msgid "Todavía no la supera"
msgstr "Not passed yet"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:124
msgid ""
"Cada reto vale más si se resuelve al primer intento. Al tercer error el "
"juego muestra la respuesta y explica por qué."
msgstr ""
"Each challenge is worth more when solved on the first try. On the third "
"mistake the game shows the answer and explains why."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:125
msgid "«Necesito una pista» da una ayuda sin restar puntos."
msgstr "\"I need a hint\" gives help without taking away points."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:126
msgid ""
"Antes de terminar, el juego repite retos parecidos a los que costaron. "
"Ese repaso no cambia el puntaje."
msgstr ""
"Before finishing, the game repeats challenges similar to the ones that "
"were hard. That review does not change the score."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:127
msgid ""
"Al final el estudiante ve lo que dominó y lo que debe reforzar, con una "
"pista concreta."
msgstr ""
"At the end the student sees what they mastered and what to reinforce, "
"with a concrete tip."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:128
msgid ""
"Si se pierde la conexión, la partida se guarda en el dispositivo y se "
"envía al volver a conectarse."
msgstr ""
"If the connection drops, the game is saved on the device and sent when it"
" reconnects."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:151
msgid ""
"Los juegos siguen el Diseño Universal para el Aprendizaje (DUA): cada "
"actividad presenta la información de varias formas, permite responder de "
"varias maneras y da retroalimentación sin castigar el error."
msgstr ""
"The games follow Universal Design for Learning (UDL): each activity "
"presents information in several ways, allows answering in several ways "
"and gives feedback without punishing mistakes."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:152
msgid "La barra superior de cada juego tiene:"
msgstr "Each game's top bar has:"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:154
#: app/templates/games/play.html:83 app/templates/modules/lesson.html:17
msgid "Leer en voz alta"
msgstr "Read aloud"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:154
msgid "Lee la consigna con la voz del dispositivo."
msgstr "Reads the instructions with the device's voice."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:155
#: app/templates/games/play.html:87
msgid "Sonidos"
msgstr "Sounds"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:155
msgid "Activa o apaga los sonidos de acierto y error."
msgstr "Turns the right and wrong answer sounds on or off."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:156
#: app/templates/games/play.html:92
msgid "Alto contraste"
msgstr "High contrast"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:156
msgid "Colores más marcados para baja visión."
msgstr "Stronger colors for low vision."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:157
msgid "Cambia el tamaño del texto."
msgstr "Changes the text size."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:158
#: app/templates/games/play.html:98
msgid "Reducir movimiento"
msgstr "Reduce motion"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:158
msgid "Quita animaciones."
msgstr "Removes animations."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:159
#: app/templates/games/play.html:103
msgid "Necesito una pista"
msgstr "I need a hint"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:159
msgid "Muestra una ayuda para el reto actual."
msgstr "Shows help for the current challenge."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:161
msgid "Todo se puede usar con teclado y con lector de pantalla."
msgstr "Everything works with a keyboard and a screen reader."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:167
msgid ""
"Solo para administradores. «Usuarios» y «Docentes y grupos» se abren "
"desde el menú de tu cuenta, en la esquina superior derecha."
msgstr ""
"Administrators only. “Users” and “Teachers and groups” open from your "
"account menu, in the top right corner."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:169
msgid ""
"«+ Nueva cuenta» crea administradores (solo el administrador principal), "
"docentes y estudiantes. Al crear un estudiante eliges su grupo."
msgstr ""
"\"+ New account\" creates administrators (main administrator only), "
"teachers and students. When you create a student you choose their group."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:170
msgid "Filtra por rol y cambia entre cuentas activas y archivadas."
msgstr "Filter by role and switch between active and archived accounts."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:171
msgid ""
"«Eliminar» archiva la cuenta: la persona ya no ingresa, pero todo su "
"registro se conserva con la fecha y quién la archivó. En «Archivadas» "
"puedes restaurarla."
msgstr ""
"\"Delete\" archives the account: the person can no longer sign in, but "
"their whole record is kept with the date and who archived it. You can "
"restore it under \"Archived\"."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:172
msgid "La cuenta del administrador principal no se puede archivar."
msgstr "The main administrator's account cannot be archived."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:173
msgid ""
"Como administrador ves los grupos y estudiantes de todos los docentes, y "
"el «Panel del instituto» suma la actividad de todos."
msgstr ""
"As an administrator you see every teacher’s groups and students, and the "
"“Institute overview” adds up everyone’s activity."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:174
msgid ""
"En «Docentes y grupos» pasas un grupo completo a otro docente, por "
"ejemplo cuando alguien se retira. Los estudiantes conservan su progreso."
msgstr ""
"In “Teachers and groups” you hand a whole group to another teacher, for "
"example when someone leaves. Students keep their progress."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:181
msgid ""
"En el menú de tu cuenta, «Perfil» te permite cambiar tu nombre, correo, "
"área y contraseña. «Cerrar sesión» sale de la plataforma."
msgstr ""
"In your account menu, \"Profile\" lets you change your name, email, area "
"and password. \"Sign out\" leaves the platform."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:182
msgid ""
"Si olvidas tu contraseña, usa «¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?» en la página de"
" ingreso."
msgstr ""
"If you forget your password, use \"Forgot your password?\" on the sign-in"
" page."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:188
msgid "Un estudiante no puede ingresar."
msgstr "A student cannot sign in."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:189
msgid ""
"Revisa que entre por «Estudiante», que su cuenta no esté inactiva en el "
"grupo y que no haya sido archivada."
msgstr ""
"Check that they use \"Student\", that their account is not inactive in "
"the group and that it has not been archived."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:192
msgid "Un estudiante no ve un juego."
msgstr "A student cannot see a game."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:193
msgid ""
"El estudiante solo ve los juegos de los trastornos que tiene asignados. "
"Revísalos con «Editar» en Registro de estudiantes."
msgstr ""
"Students only see the games for the conditions assigned to them. Check "
"them with \"Edit\" in Student registry."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:196
msgid "Jugué en Modo maestro y no aparece en el panel."
msgstr "I played in Teacher Mode and it does not show on the dashboard."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:197
msgid ""
"Es lo esperado: las partidas de docentes y administradores son vista "
"previa y no se guardan."
msgstr ""
"That is expected: games played by teachers and administrators are "
"previews and are not saved."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:200
msgid "Eliminé una cuenta por error."
msgstr "I deleted an account by mistake."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:201
msgid ""
"Pídele a un administrador que la restaure desde Usuarios → Archivadas. Su"
" progreso sigue completo."
msgstr ""
"Ask an administrator to restore it from Users → Archived. Their progress "
"is still complete."

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:204
msgid "¿Por qué no hay videos en Lengua de Señas Colombiana?"
msgstr "Why are there no Colombian Sign Language videos?"

#: app/templates/dashboard/teacher/guias_uso.html:205
msgid ""
"Los videos de LSC solo se publican cuando un intérprete los valida. "
"Mientras tanto, El Enigma Lingüístico usa apoyos visuales y texto."
msgstr ""
"LSC videos are only published once an interpreter validates them. "
"Meanwhile, The Language Enigma uses visual supports and text."

